nuScenes-derived results
------------------------
The evidence documents (docs/evidence/), the claims registry that restates their
values (docs/claims.yaml), the figures (docs/figures/), the derived analyses
(docs/analysis/), and their copies and result tables on the website are aggregate
measurements computed from the nuScenes v1.0-trainval dataset. They contain no
camera images, LiDAR point clouds, sample or box tokens, or scene names.

nuScenes is provided by Motional under the nuScenes terms of use
(https://www.nuscenes.org/terms-of-use), which allow non-commercial use under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0). These aggregate results are shared for non-commercial research
under the same terms. The dataset itself is not redistributed here; obtain it from
its original distribution and follow its terms.

