Pretrained initialization weights
---------------------------------
The learned corrector was initialized from the timm profile
convnextv2_tiny.fcmae_ft_in1k. Its model card
(https://huggingface.co/timm/convnextv2_tiny.fcmae_ft_in1k) declares the
CC BY-NC 4.0 licence. The weights come from ConvNeXt V2 (Woo et al., "ConvNeXt V2:
Co-designing and Scaling ConvNets with Masked Autoencoders", CVPR 2023). Neither the
pretrained weights nor any trained checkpoint is distributed here.

